This repository is a CONSOLIDATION LAYER. It contains no OpenOCD source code
of its own; it redistributes TCL configuration files and a C-source worklist
collected from public third-party OpenOCD forks.

THEREFORE NO SINGLE LICENCE APPLIES TO THE WHOLE REPOSITORY.

  * Upstream OpenOCD is GPL-2.0-or-later (openocd-org/openocd).
  * Most collected files are expected to carry the same terms, but their
    per-file provenance records a source licence of NOASSERTION for most of
    them, which means GitHub could not determine the terms - NOT that the
    terms are permissive.
  * Some source repositories carry proprietary notices. For example
    analogdevicesinc/openocd flash algorithms state "This software is
    proprietary to Analog Devices, Inc."

BEFORE ANY COMMERCIAL USE you must audit the licence header of every file you
intend to redistribute. The machine-readable index is:

    manifest/licenses.csv            every file -> repo / branch / commit /
                                      licence
    docs/03-LICENSES.md              human-readable version of the same data
    overlay/PROVENANCE.json          authoritative provenance, first layer
    manifest/tier2/PROVENANCE.json   authoritative provenance, second layer

This repository is distributed WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY, to the extent permitted
by law.